    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nGrimes are delighted to present Halltown House to the market. This spacious four bedroom detached family home offers generous and practical living accommodation throughout, complemented by beautifully maintained gardens. Extending to approximately 240 sq.m / 2,583 sq.ft, this impressive property is ideal for modern family living. Accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to the main living room, which features laminate wood flooring, a bay window allowing for an abundance of natural light, an open fireplace, and a single door to the dining area. A second reception room offers additional living space and includes carpet flooring and an open fireplace. To the rear of the property is a bright open plan kitchen fitted with ample modern wall and floor units, along with an electric oven and hob. Adjacent to the kitchen is the dining area with laminate wood flooring and access to the conservatory overlooking the rear garden. A large utility room with tiled flooring and additional storage presses provides further practicality. Completing the ground floor is a third reception room/home office and an integrated garage with roller shutter door. Upstairs, there are four well proportioned bedrooms, all featuring carpet flooring and built in wardrobes. The master bedroom benefits from a fully tiled ensuite bathroom with walk in shower. The remaining bedrooms are serviced by a spacious fully tiled family bathroom complete with walk in shower and Jacuzzi bath. Additional features include electric gates, CCTV cameras, oil fired central heating with a recently upgraded burner, a water filtration system, and mains water supply. The beautifully manicured rear garden enjoys a sought after South West facing orientation.\nIdeally located in Halltown on the Skryne Road, the property is approximately 3 kilometres from Ratoath Village and its excellent range of amenities, including schools, shops, restaurants, and sporting facilities. Emerald Park (formerly Tayto Park) is also within close proximity.\nViewing is a must!\n\nEntrance Hallway - 1.37m (4'6) x 4.7m (15'5)\nTiled floor, ceiling coving,\n\nGuest W.C. - 0.8m (2'7) x 1.55m (5'1)\nComprising w.c. w.h.b. Tiled floor.\n\nFamily Room - 4.88m (16'0) x 4.28m (14'1)\nLaminate wood floor, ceiling coving, bay window, feature fireplace with solid fuel grate, marble hearth timber surround. Door to dining room.\n\nDining Room - 4.22m (13'10) x 3.08m (10'1)\nLaminate wood floor, ceiling coving, centrepiece, sliding doors to conservatory.\n\nConservatory - 4.08m (13'5) x 3.08m (10'1)\nTiled floor, recessed lights, patio doors to rear garden.\n\nKitchen - 6.53m (21'5) x 3.53m (11'7)\nRange of floor eye level fitted press units with marble worktop and upstands. Integrated dishwasher, double oven, microwave, electric hob extractor fan. Ceiling coving. Tiled floor sliding doors to rear garden.\n\nUtility - 3.88m (12'9) x 3.01m (9'11)\nFitted press units for additional storage tiled floor. Plumbed for washing machine tumble dryer.\n\nLiving Room - 4.26m (14'0) x 4.24m (13'11)\nCarpet floor, ceiling coving, centrepiece, feature fireplace with solid fuel grate, marble hearth timber surround.\n\nReception Room - 3.88m (12'9) x 3.03m (9'11)\nTiled floor, recessed lights, French patio doors.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.29m (14'1) x 3.36m (11'0)\nTo front of house with laminate wood floor built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.39m (4'7) x 1.88m (6'2)\nComprising w.c. w.h.b. with vanity unit walk in power shower. Fully tiled. Heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.18m (13'9) x 3.1m (10'2)\nTo front of house with carpet floor built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.24m (13'11) x 3.59m (11'9)\nTo rear of house with carpet floor built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.26m (14'0) x 3.29m (10'10)\nTo rear of house with carpet floor built in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.13m (7'0) x 2.73m (8'11)\nFully tiled with w.c., w.h.b with vanity unit, Jacuzzi bath, separate power shower. Heated towel rail.\n\n\nwhat3words /// windowsill.lamp.seeking\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n\n"
